/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road.mem:725:# ''Built'': fleet join on every face carries a device edge, face certificates, grants, a sealed address secret, the charter, the household admit and the floor pins; the admit and fleet answer sign the full sovereign sync route pin after N's cosign door.
