/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road.mem:755:# ''Live'': the issuer, reader, hosting store and sorter take the one hosting-act cut; the serving rows receive grant public halves before E's walker arm.
