/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road.mem:774:# ''Built'': the browser custody API, its slot tree, refusal and reopen (`browser-custody.ts`). Its boot caller, the persona roots' seal and the passkey slot stay owed (`B1`).
