/home/joshu/Synthetic-Dream-Machine/bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/stable-founding-road.mem:781:# The automated witness: two vessels from one image digest, no volume in common, a courier that carries files alone; it proves two seeds, one AID on both sides, each founder held at the other's gate, an edit crossing both ways and reading back after each restart and unlock, a third root ADDED as a seat and contracted as a carrier, and a dormant node that wakes, imports the lineage and presents its admit.
