tus --trial-root` reads its owned Content and frontiers.", handler: cmdSense, accepts: ["agent", "all", "all-strata", "approve", "as-of", "channel", "confirm", "device", "drain", "dry-run", "ephemeral", "force", "freeze-receipt", "function", "grounds", "halves", "hold", "imago", "intent", "k", "keep-hooks", "lens", "limit", "list", "min-count", "model-home", "names", "not-root", "pair", "palace", "project", "reason", "repour", "revision", "room", "self-weight", "sensorium-root", "session-id", "signal", "source-host", "source-key", "span", "speaker", "spectral", "store-swap", "surface", "trial-root", "wing", "writeback"] },
